<title>USA: Alamco Inc Q4 net decreases.</title>
<headline>Alamco Inc Q4 net decreases.</headline>
<dateline>CLARKSBURG, W.Va. 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended  Twelve Months Ended</p>
<p>				    December 31,     December 31,</p>
<p>				1996	1995	 1996	 1995</p>
<p> Total revenues	  6,559	8,400     23,065     18,539</p>
<p>Option plan compensation</p>
<p>			     (165)	   58	1,653	  784</p>
<p> Net income		1,108	2,188	2,671	1,279</p>
<p> Net income per share   0.23	 0.47	 0.54	 0.27</p>
<p>Weighted average number</p>
<p>of shares</p>
<p>  outstanding	4,926,466  4,697,020  4,920,131  4,679,703</p>
<p>			   (in thousands, except share data)</p>
<p>NOTE:  Net income for the fourth quarter and fiscal 1995 included $2,537,000 in after tax income from the Columbia settlement.</p>
</text>
